    """
    Compute square-free norm of ``f``.

    Returns ``s``, ``f``, ``r``, such that ``g(x) = f(x-sa)`` and
    ``r(x) = Norm(g(x))`` is a square-free polynomial over ``K``,
    where ``a`` is the algebraic extension of the ground domain.

